--          Sort Key: (sum(amount)) DESC
--          Sort Method: top-N heapsort  Memory: 25kB
--          ->  Finalize HashAggregate  (cost=7537.10..7549.62 rows=1001 width=36) (actual time=54.760..54.963 rows=1001 loops=1)
--                Group Key: customer_id
--                Batches: 1  Memory Usage: 833kB
--                ->  Gather  (cost=7309.38..7522.09 rows=2002 width=36) (actual time=52.960..53.392 rows=3003 loops=1)
